      "settings": {
        "product": "",
        "item_label": "",
        "fund_percent": 10,
        "eyebrow": "Where your [price] goes",
        "heading": "The hat that",
        "highlight": "pays back.",
        "text": "<p>School merch pays a licensing fee to the school. We skipped that. 10% of every LACES x Cal hat goes straight into the Cal LACES Athlete Fund, and every Cal athlete who hits their monthly Activity Goals gets an equal share.</p>",
        "button_label": "Meet the athletes",
        "button_link": "shopify://pages/cal-athletes",
        "receipt_title": "LACES",
        "receipt_subtitle": "Order · Cal Athletes collab",
        "receipt_footer": "★ Thank you for backing every Cal athlete ★"
